{"metadata":{"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"BlinkID"}],"symbolKind":"property","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"presenceMandatory"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"externalID":"s:7BlinkID17MrzModuleSettingsV17presenceMandatorySbvp","title":"presenceMandatory"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID","doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/MrzModuleSettings"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"presenceMandatory"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For Single ScanningMode, the MRZ must be present on the scanned side."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For Automatic ScanningMode, the MRZ must be present on one of the scanned sides."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In case of a timeout and advancement to the next step in the scanning flow,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"if an MRZ is detected on the scanned side but cannot be extracted,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the presence requirement is considered fulfilled. As a result, MRZ extraction"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"will no longer be required to complete the scan on the next side."}]}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.microblink.BlinkID\/documentation\/BlinkID\/MrzModuleSettings\/presenceMandatory","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"variant